<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"></head>
<body>
<p>Hi {{ recipientUsername }},</p>

<p><strong>{{ senderUsername }}</strong> sent you a message on SwiftChat that you haven't read yet:</p>

<blockquote style="border-left: 3px solid #ccc; margin: 1em 0; padding: 0.5em 1em; color: #555;">
    {{ messageContent|nl2br }}
</blockquote>

<p>Sent on {{ sentAt|date('d/m/Y') }} at {{ sentAt|date('H:i') }} UTC.</p>

<p><a href="{{ app.request ? absolute_url(path('conversation_list')) : '#' }}">Open SwiftChat</a> to reply.</p>

<p style="font-size: 0.85em; color: #888;">
    You are receiving this email because you have unread message notifications enabled.
    You can disable them in your profile settings.
</p>
</body>
</html>
